    "attributes": {
        "action": "Introduce a statutory right to paid caring leave ",
        "additional_details": "Current carer\u2019s leave is often unpaid, forcing many to take annual leave, reduce their working hours or leave work. As the UK\u2019s population ages, more employees will have caring responsibilities. This could help reduce financial hardship, support mental wellbeing and recognise the vital contribution of unpaid carers.",
        "background": "Introduce paid statutory leave for employees who are caring for seriously ill or elderly relatives.",
